
### Define an on-demand template
$ lf machine ondemand add qa --provider daytona --vcpus 1 --memory-gb 1 --max 2 --max-usd-per-hour 1
Added on-demand qa: 1 vCPU 1 GB on daytona at $0.06714/h; at most 2 at once, 4h each
(exit 0)

### Rent
$ lf machine ondemand rent qa
Renting 1 vCPU 1 GB on daytona at $0.06714/h until 12:34
Rented qa-1: 1 vCPU 1 GB at $0.06714/h, at most $0.26856 until 12:34
Next: `lf machine connect qa-1 github` and `lf machine connect qa-1 claude`; `lf machine end qa-1` gives it back
(exit 0)

